  speakerName: VENDOR KYROS
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Sometimes you want to give someone a general greeting without focusing
    on morning, afternoon, or evening.


    In Ilokano, ''naimbag nga aldaw'' means
    ''good day.''


    It is a general greeting that can be used to wish someone
    a pleasant day.


    Listen carefully: naimbag nga aldaw.


    Now, try saying
    ''naimbag nga aldaw'' yourself.'
